  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed enlargement of existing detached single storey garage by inclusion of a bathroom and kitchen would not be incidental to main dwellinghouse and would be used as a self-contained accommodation by current or future occupants, causing a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by residents of that area contrary to Local Plan Policy, SC7 and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines (2024) and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed enlargement of existing detached single storey garage would by reason of its height, design and loss of original eaves be out of scale and character with this and surrounding dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality and the character and appearance of the Gunnersbury Park conservation area. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, policies of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal would result in the loss of an off-street parking space and insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that the loss of parking would not adversely affect parking provision or highway conditions. As such, the proposal fails to comply with the requirements of Local Plan Policy EC2 and the National Planning Policy Framework.\r\n\r\n"
  ],
